OL,3,AMajor study into 'forever chemicals' in
OL,4,Apeople's bodies launched in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is launching its first
OL,7,Fstudy into the levels of so-called
OL,8,F'forever chemicals' in the UK
OL,9,Fpopulation.
OL,11,FBy taking blood and urine samples, the
OL,12,FUK Health Security Agency (UKHSA) hopes
OL,13,Fto gain a better understanding of any
OL,14,Fpotential health risks caused by the
OL,15,Fsubstances also known as PFAS, as well
OL,16,Fas other potential contaminants like
OL,17,Flead and arsenic.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
