OL,3,AMajor study into 'forever chemicals' in
OL,4,Apeople's bodies launched in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said current evidence suggested the
OL,7,Fpossible health impacts associated with
OL,8,FPFAS are likely to be limited, but said
OL,9,Fthe strongest links found in large
OL,10,Fpopulation groups have been to raised
OL,11,Fcholesterol and lower birth weights.
OL,13,FThe first results are expected next
OL,14,Fyear.
